mpañero","Your team":"Tu equipo","Yum yum!":"¡Ñam ñam!","[Box] ":"[Caja] ","anywhere, through your phone":"en cualquier sitio, con tu móvil","burn!":"quemadura!","empty":"vacío","from TEAM":"desde EQUIPO","h to go":"h restantes","in a usual week":"en una semana normal","keep up ":"mantienes ","m: JOY +":"m: ALEGRÍA +","now about ":"ahora unos ","poison!":"veneno!","space":"espacio","vs ":"vs ","watch to watch, no phone":"de reloj a reloj, sin móvil","{0}'s {1}{2}":"¡{1} de {0}{2}","TRADE":"INTERCAMBIO","Pick a pet to trade":"Elige a quién intercambiar","START: offer":"START: ofrecer","You give":"Das","You get":"Recibes","Traded!":"¡Intercambiado!","Joined your team!":"¡Se une a tu equipo!","TRADE AGAIN":"OTRO","Your team is empty":"Tu equipo está vacío","GUIDE":"GUÍA","BASICS":"LO BÁSICO","EXP & LEVELS":"EXP Y NIVELES","FOOD & FRUIT":"COMIDA Y FRUTA","EGGS":"HUEVOS","BATTLES & GYMS":"COMBATES Y GIMNASIOS","TEAM & PET BOX":"EQUIPO Y CAJA","BUTTONS":"BOTONES","Your partner lives on your watch. Feed it with the apple and bathe it with the drop. Its energy is your Body Battery, and it sleeps when you do. Its joy comes from your workouts. Being active earns it EXP, fruit and eggs.":"Tu compañero vive en tu reloj. Dale de comer con la manzana y báñalo con la gota. Su energía es tu Body Battery, y duerme cuando tú duermes. Su alegría viene de tus entrenamientos. Ser activo le da EXP, fruta y huevos.","Each workout you record (5 min or more) fills joy and trains a stat: running SPEED, cycling and swimming DEFENSE, strength and gym ATTACK; walks, hikes and the rest train a random one. Joy slowly drops over a week, so keep up your trainings per week. The football has three mini-games.":"Cada entrenamiento que registras (5 min o más) llena la alegría y entrena una estadística: correr VELOCIDAD, bici y natación DEFENSA, fuerza y gimnasio ATAQUE; paseos, senderismo y el resto, una al azar. La alegría baja poco a poco durante una semana: mantén tus entrenamientos semanales. El balón tiene tres minijuegos.","Every 15,000 steps earns an egg, at most 2 in any 7 days. Steps carry over until you reach 15,000, but while you already have 2 eggs from the last 7 days they don't count. Open the app to collect it, then walk 1,000 to 3,000 steps to hatch it. It joins your team, or the pet box if the team is full.":"Cada 15.000 pasos ganas un huevo, como máximo 2 cada 7 días. Los pasos se acumulan hasta llegar a 15.000, pero mientras ya tengas 2 huevos de los últimos 7 días no cuentan. Abre la app para recogerlo y camina de 1.000 a 3.000 pasos para que eclosione. Se une a tu equipo, o a la caja si el equipo está lleno.","Fight wild creatures from the menu and beat the 8 gyms in order to earn badges. Hard gyms are tougher and stay closed while your Body Battery is 20% or less. Link battles let you fight a friend online through your phone, or nearby watch to watch.":"Lucha contra criaturas salvajes desde el menú y vence los 8 gimnasios en orden para ganar medallas. Los gimnasios difíciles son más duros y están cerrados mientras tu Body Battery esté al 20% o menos. Los combates enlace te dejan luchar con un amigo en línea con tu móvil, o cerca, de reloj a reloj.","Your team holds 6: your partner plus 5. The rest wait in the pet box. There you can make any team member your partner, swap creatures between the team and the box, see their stats or release them.":"Tu equipo tiene 6: tu compañero y 5 más. El resto espera en la caja. Allí puedes hacer compañero a cualquier miembro del equipo, cambiar criaturas entre el equipo y la caja, ver sus estadísticas o liberarlas.","Vibration turns the buzz on or off. Care alerts send reminders when your partner needs you, and news about eggs. Trainings/week is your weekly workout target; it adjusts to what you really do. Language changes the whole app.":"Vibración activa o desactiva la vibración. Avisos te envía recordatorios cuando tu compañero te necesita, y noticias de los huevos. Entrenos/semana es tu objetivo semanal de entrenamientos; se ajusta a lo que haces de verdad. Idioma cambia toda la app.","UP and DOWN move, START picks and BACK goes back. Hold UP, or pick the book, for the menu. In the Pokedex and the pet box, UP and DOWN turn pages until START picks on the page.":"UP y DOWN mueven, START elige y BACK vuelve atrás. Mantén UP, o elige el libro, para el menú. En la Pokédex y la caja, UP y DOWN pasan páginas hasta que START elige en la página.","Every 50 steps give 1 EXP and every intensity minute 10 EXP. Steps add up over time: a few now and a few later still count. Battles give EXP too: wild fights a few times a day, gyms and link battles more. Your partner gets all of it and the rest of the team 25%. New levels teach moves and let it evolve.":"Cada 50 pasos dan 1 EXP y cada minuto de intensidad 10 EXP. Los pasos se acumulan: unos cuantos ahora y otros más tarde también cuentan. Los combates también dan: los salvajes unas cuantas veces al día, los gimnasios y los combates enlace más. Tu compañero lo recibe todo y el resto del equipo el 25%. Los niveles nuevos enseñan movimientos y le hacen evolucionar.","Fruit is earned: an apple for every 3,000 steps (they add up over time, so 2,000 now and 1,000 later earn it), for every 20 active minutes and at each third of your step goal; a berry or an orange for each workout and for reaching your step goal; candy for your weekly goal and each gym win. Every species has a favourite fruit.":"La fruta se gana: una manzana por cada 3.000 pasos (se acumulan, así que 2.000 ahora y 1.000 después también la ganan), por cada 20 minutos activos y en cada tercio de tu meta de pasos; una baya o una naranja por cada entrenamiento y por llegar a tu meta de pasos; caramelos por la meta semanal y por cada gimnasio ganado. Cada especie tiene una fruta favorita.","TACKLE":"PLACAJE","SCRATCH":"ARAÑAZO","POUND":"DESTRUCTOR","FURY ATTACK":"ATAQUE FURIA","QUICK ATTACK":"ATAQUE RÁPIDO","SWIFT":"RAPIDEZ","BODY SLAM":"GOLPE CUERPO","DOUBLE-EDGE":"DOBLE FILO","HYPER BEAM":"HIPERRAYO","PECK":"PICOTAZO","EMBER":"ASCUAS","FIRE PUNCH":"PUÑO FUEGO","FLAMETHROWER":"LANZALLAMAS","FIRE BLAST":"LLAMARADA","BUBBLE":"BURBUJA","WATER GUN":"PISTOLA AGUA","WATERFALL":"CASCADA","SURF":"SURF","HYDRO PUMP":"HIDROBOMBA","SPARK":"CHISPA","THUNDERSHOCK":"IMPACTRUENO","THUNDERPUNCH":"PUÑO TRUENO","THUNDERBOLT":"RAYO","THUNDER":"TRUENO","ABSORB":"ABSORBER","VINE WHIP":"LÁTIGO CEPA","RAZOR LEAF":"HOJA AFILADA","MEGA DRAIN":"MEGAAGOTAR","SOLAR BEAM":"RAYO SOLAR","AURORA BEAM":"RAYO AURORA","ICE PUNCH":"PUÑO HIELO","ICE BEAM":"RAYO HIELO","BLIZZARD":"VENTISCA","KARATE CHOP":"GOLPE KÁRATE","SEISMIC TOSS":"MOVIMIENTO SÍSMICO","SUBMISSION":"SUMISIÓN","HI JUMP KICK":"PATADA SALTO ALTA","POISON STING":"PICOTAZO VENENO","ACID":"ÁCIDO","SLUDGE":"RESIDUOS","SLUDGE BOMB":"BOMBA LODO","BONE CLUB":"HUESO PALO","DIG":"EXCAVAR","EARTHQUAKE":"TERREMOTO","WING ATTACK":"ATAQUE ALA","DRILL PECK":"PICO TALADRO","FLY":"VUELO","PSYWAVE":"PSICOONDA","CONFUSION":"CONFUSIÓN","PSYBEAM":"PSICORRAYO","PSYCHIC":"PSÍQUICO","BUG BITE":"PICADURA","PIN MISSILE":"PIN MISIL","LEECH LIFE":"CHUPAVIDAS","MEGAHORN":"MEGACUERNO","BUG BUZZ":"ZUMBIDO","X-SCISSOR":"TIJERA X","ROCK SMASH":"GOLPE ROCA","ROCK THROW":"LANZARROCAS","ROCK SLIDE":"AVALANCHA","ANCIENTPOWER":"PODER PASADO","LICK":"LENGÜETAZO","NIGHT SHADE":"TINIEBLA","SHADOW BALL":"BOLA SOMBRA","DRAGON RAGE":"FURIA DRAGÓN","DRAGON CLAW":"GARRA DRAGÓN","OUTRAGE":"ENFADO","BITE":"MORDISCO","CRUNCH":"TRITURAR","IRON HEAD":"CABEZA HIERRO","FLASH CANNON":"FOGONAZO","DAZZLE GLEAM":"BRILLO MÁGICO","PLAY ROUGH":"CARANTOÑA","MOONBLAST":"FUERZA LUNAR","SWORDS DANCE":"DANZA ESPADA","AGILITY":"AGILIDAD","BARRIER":"BARRERA","AMNESIA":"AMNESIA","NASTY PLOT":"MAQUINACIÓN","DRAGON DANCE":"DANZA DRAGÓN","BULK UP":"CORPULENCIA","GROWL":"GRUÑIDO","LEER":"MALICIOSO","SCREECH":"CHIRRIDO","STRING SHOT":"DISPARO DEMORA","RECOVER":"RECUPERACIÓN","SOFT-BOILED":"AMORTIGUADOR","STRUGGLE":"FORCEJEO","DARK PULSE":"PULSO UMBRÍO","NORMAL":"NORMAL","FIRE":"FUEGO","WATER":"AGUA","ELECTRIC":"ELÉCTRICO","GRASS":"PLANTA","ICE":"HIELO","FIGHTING":"LUCHA","POISON":"VENENO","GROUND":"TIERRA","FLYING":"VOLADOR","BUG":"BICHO","ROCK":"ROCA","GHOST":"FANTASMA","DRAGON":"DRAGÓN","DARK":"SINIESTRO","STEEL":"ACERO","FAIRY":"HADA"}